<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<body>
<p>Hi {{.Name}},</p>
<p>The copy of your data you asked for is ready. Download it from Account settings:</p>
<p><a href="{{.URL}}">{{.URL}}</a></p>
{{if .ExpiresAt}}<p>The file is deleted on {{.ExpiresAt}}. You can ask for a new copy once a day.</p>{{end}}
<p>If you did not ask for a copy of your data, change your password and sign out your other sessions in Account settings.</p>
</body>
</html>
